{
  "info": {
    "name": "Banglish API v2",
    "description": "Complete API collection for Banglish Backend with Auth, Users, Profile, Presence, and Socket.IO",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "refreshToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const response = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', response.data.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', response.data.refreshToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', response.data.user.id);",
                  "    pm.test('Registration successful', () => {",
                  "        pm.expect(response.success).to.be.true;",
                  "        pm.expect(response.data.accessToken).to.exist;",
                  "        pm.expect(response.data.refreshToken).to.exist;",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"test@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Test@123456\",\n  \"profile\": {\n    \"fullName\": \"Test User\",\n    \"country\": \"Bangladesh\",\n    \"division\": \"Dhaka\",\n    \"district\": \"Dhaka\",\n    \"bio\": \"Software Developer\",\n    \"gender\": \"Male\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Register a new user with email/phone and profile data.\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `email` (optional if phone provided)\n- `phone` (optional if email provided)\n- `password` (required, min 6 chars)\n- `profile` (optional)\n  - `fullName`, `country`, `division`, `district`, `bio`, `gender`, etc.\n\n**Response:**\n- `accessToken` - Short-lived (15 min)\n- `refreshToken` - Long-lived (7 days)\n- `user` - User object with profile"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201 || pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const response = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', response.data.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', response.data.refreshToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', response.data.user.id);",
                  "    pm.test('Login successful', () => {",
                  "        pm.expect(response.success).to.be.true;",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"test@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Test@123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login with email/phone and password.\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `email` OR `phone`\n- `password`\n\n**Response:**\n- `accessToken` - Use for API requests\n- `refreshToken` - Use to get new tokens"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Tokens",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const response = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', response.data.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', response.data.refreshToken);",
                  "    pm.test('Tokens refreshed', () => {",
                  "        pm.expect(response.success).to.be.true;",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Get new access and refresh tokens using refresh token.\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `refreshToken` - The refresh token from login/register\n\n**Response:**\n- New `accessToken` and `refreshToken`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Logout and invalidate refresh token.\n\n**Headers:**\n- `Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Current User Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/profile",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "profile"]
            },
            "description": "Get current authenticated user's profile."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"test@example.com\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "forgot-password"]
            },
            "description": "Request password reset link via email or SMS.\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `email` OR `phone`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"resetToken\": \"token-from-email-or-sms\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"NewPassword@123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "reset-password"]
            },
            "description": "Reset password using the token from forgot-password."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "👤 Users",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Current User (Me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Get current authenticated user's data with profile."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get All Users (Admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users"]
            },
            "description": "Get all users. **Admin only.**"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get User by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "{{userId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Get specific user by ID."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update User",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"newemail@example.com\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "{{userId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Update user. Users can only update their own profile. Admins can update any."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Deactivate User (Admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/deactivate",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "{{userId}}", "deactivate"]
            },
            "description": "Deactivate a user account. **Admin only.**"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Activate User (Admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/activate",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "{{userId}}", "activate"]
            },
            "description": "Activate a user account. **Admin only.**"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete User (Admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "{{userId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Delete a user. **Admin only.**"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "📝 Profile",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get My Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/profile/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["profile", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Get current user's profile with interested languages."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update My Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"fullName\": \"Updated Name\",\n  \"country\": \"Bangladesh\",\n  \"division\": \"Chittagong\",\n  \"district\": \"Chittagong\",\n  \"bio\": \"Updated bio\",\n  \"ownLanguage\": \"Bengali\",\n  \"interestedLanguageIds\": []\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/profile/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["profile", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Update current user's profile.\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `fullName`, `country`, `division`, `district`, `bio`, `gender`, etc.\n- `ownLanguage` - User's native language\n- `interestedLanguageIds` - Array of language UUIDs"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Profile Picture",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"profilePicture\": \"https://example.com/photo.jpg\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/profile/me/picture",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["profile", "me", "picture"]
            },
            "description": "Update profile picture URL."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get All Languages",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/profile/languages",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["profile", "languages"]
            },
            "description": "Get all available languages."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Languages with User Count",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/profile/languages/stats",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["profile", "languages", "stats"]
            },
            "description": "Get all languages with count of users who speak each."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Language (Admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Bengali\",\n  \"code\": \"bn\",\n  \"nativeName\": \"বাংলা\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/profile/languages",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["profile", "languages"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new language. **Admin only.**"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Find Users by Language",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/profile/users/by-language?language=Bengali",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["profile", "users", "by-language"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "language",
                  "value": "Bengali"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Find all users who speak a specific language."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🟢 Presence (Active Users)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Active Users",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/presence/active?page=1&limit=50",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["presence", "active"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1",
                  "description": "Page number (default: 1)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "50",
                  "description": "Items per page (default: 50, max: 100)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Get all currently online/active users with pagination.\n\n**Response for each user:**\n- `id` - User ID\n- `isOnline` - Online status\n- `lastSeen` - Last activity timestamp\n- `profile`:\n  - `fullName` - User's name\n  - `profilePicture` - Photo URL\n  - `country` - User's country\n  - `interestedLanguages` - Array of languages user is interested in"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Online Count",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/presence/count",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["presence", "count"]
            },
            "description": "Get count of currently online users."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🔌 Socket.IO Events",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Connection Guide",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"]
            },
            "description": "## Socket.IO Connection\n\n**Connect with token:**\n```javascript\nconst socket = io('http://localhost:3000', {\n  auth: { token: 'your-access-token' }\n});\n```\n\n## Server → Client Events\n\n| Event | Payload | Description |\n|-------|---------|-------------|\n| `user:online` | `{ userId, timestamp }` | User came online |\n| `user:offline` | `{ userId, timestamp }` | User went offline |\n| `presence:count` | `{ count }` | Online count on connect |\n| `error` | `{ message }` | Error occurred |\n\n## Client → Server Events\n\n| Event | Payload | Description |\n|-------|---------|-------------|\n| `presence:getActiveUsers` | `{ page?, limit? }` | Get active users |\n| `presence:getCount` | - | Get online count |\n| `presence:isOnline` | `{ userId }` | Check if user online |\n| `presence:heartbeat` | - | Keep-alive ping |"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
